PERSONNEL -- KAZEKAGE COMMENDATIONS REGISTER
Issued by the office of the Fifth Kazekage, Lord Gaara

The Kazekage recognizes shinobi whose service honors the village. Commendations
are entered here and noted in the recipient's performance file.

Recorded commendations:
- To Kankuro of the Sand Siblings, for valor in the pursuit of the traitor
  Sasori and for enduring grievous poison in defense of the Kazekage's rescue.
- To Temari of the Sand Siblings, for exemplary conduct in strengthening the
  alliance with Konohagakure and for command in the field with the war fan.
- To the memory of the honored elder Chiyo, posthumously, for the sacrifice that
  restored the Fifth Kazekage to life. The village's highest honor.
- To the joint Sand reconnaissance cells, for vigilance along the Wind frontier.

Lord Gaara holds that recognition binds the village as surely as discipline. All
entries are permanent and countersigned by the Kazekage Office.
